Whale Dream is an independently assembled integration of several components.
It is not an official release of DSH, Dream Skin, ASCII Whales, SJ, or
dsh-bottom-info-bar.

This package must NOT be described as wholly MIT-licensed.

- dsh-dream-skin 11.7.0 and its derived runtime: MIT, copyright (c) 2026
  dsh-dream-skin contributors. Full terms: licenses/dsh-dream-skin-LICENSE.
